## Part 3 — Host tests for the generator

All in-module `#[cfg(test)]` (house style; no crate-level `tests/` dir exists anywhere in the workspace). Live in the measured lib modules so Sonar sees the coverage.

**The D8-mandated layout snapshot** — `ipc_h.rs`:

```rust
#[test]
fn ipc_h_pins_the_live_message_layout() {
    // Snapshots the GENERATED text against Message's own const asserts: the
    // generator must never hardcode 104/8/8, and a Rust-side layout change
    // must show up in the header or fail here.
    let h = render();
    let m = Message { m_source: 0, m_type: 0, payload: [0; 96] };
    let base = &m as *const _ as usize;
    let payload_off = m.payload.as_ptr() as usize - base;

    assert!(h.contains(&format!("sizeof(message) == {}", size_of::<Message>())));
    assert!(h.contains(&format!("_Alignof(message) == {}", align_of::<Message>())));
    assert!(h.contains(&format!("offsetof(message, payload) == {payload_off}")));
    assert_eq!(size_of::<Message>(), 104);   // the ABI number itself, pinned
    assert_eq!(payload_off, 8);
}
```

